     "id": 1173559,
     "content_html": "prepared for a joint invasion of Korea with the Chinese"
    },
    {
     "id": 1173558,
     "content_html": "sent a peace delegation to Formosa"
    },
    {
     "id": 1173560,
     "content_html": "were willing to accept American control of Korea"
    },
    {
     "id": 1173557,
     "content_html": "warned the United States that nuclear war was possible"
    }
